  "query_preview": "..\nKEY MESSAGE 1...Below normal temperatures continue for the beginning\nof the week before warming takes hold towards mid-late week.\n\nHigh pressure across the Midwest will continue to slowly approach\ninto Tue/Wed. It'll crest over the area during the mid-week and\nadvance offshore Thu/Fri. Ahead of the high, a northwest flow \nhas brought some below normal temperatures for the northern \nMiddle Atlantic (and surrounding) regions. These will continue \ntonight and into Monday before moderation begins later Mon/Tue. \nWhile highs moderate Tue, the low temperatures may remain a bit \nbelow normal further into the midweek. Fair weather expected \nthrough the end of the upcoming week.",
